        {
            "finding_id": "FND-0011",
            "title": "EXP-0007 independent cross-pair candidate-selection replication",
            "statement": "In mature MathGPT v0.3, EXP-0007 independently replicated cross-pair causal candidate-selection behavior for L1H0 and L4H0 on four previously untested numerical candidate pairs. Both heads passed within-pair directional stability on 4/4 new pairs, while strong arithmetic-correctness tracking did not pass (L1H0 10/16; L4H0 8/16). The P45 positive control and L4H1 weak-control criterion both passed, and both primary heads showed pair-dependent rather than uniform lower/upper orientation.",
            "finding_type": "preregistered_causal_replication",
